web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/01/nyregion/easter-parade-new-york.html', 'snippet': 'New York’s humor and creativity were on full display at the annual Easter Parade and Easter Bonnet Festival on Sunday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Martin Burke and Autumn Ward stood on Sunday in front of St. Patrick’s Cathedral in Manhattan and struck poses for the dozens of spectators taking photographs of them. Mr. Burke wore a dapper suit and Ms. Ward a bright floral dress. The cameras, however, were pointed at the couple’s headwear: papier-mâché versions of the stone moai heads of Easter Island.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Only in New York: Easter Parade With Moai Heads and a Kraken', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Their Sunday Best? At This Parade, It Gets Even Better', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Easter and Holy Week', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parades', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hats and Caps', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "St Patrick's Cathedral (Manhattan, NY)", 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cunningham, Bill', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Easter Island', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Fifth Avenue (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-04-01T22:16:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Luis Ferré-Sadurní', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Luis', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ferré-Sadurní', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organiz