 things keep on at the current rate. Last week’s installment did not include a title card emblazoned with the words “Now, Henry is dead,” but it did show young Henry getting trampled, characters looking for him and a somber aerial shot of a graveyard. All signs indicated that the boy had passed on to the next life, but this week’s episode had other plans.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/30/arts/01walkingdead-recap/01billions-recap-slide-6916-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/03/30/arts/01walkingdead-recap/01billions-recap-slide-6916-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/30/arts/01walkingdead-recap/01billions-recap-slide-6916-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/30/arts/01walkingdead-recap/01billions-recap-slide-6916-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/30/arts/01walkingdead-recap/01billions-recap-slide-6916-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/03/30/arts/01walkingdead-recap/01billions-recap-slide-6916-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/30/arts/01walkingdead-recap/01billions-recap-slide-6916-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 1