lue': 'Customs (Tariff)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Protectionism (Trade)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'World Trade Organization', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Xi Jinping', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-04-02T02:19:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Chris Buckley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Chris', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Buckley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8b5c5f8d-92bc-59d1-8927-936c96bf4e2f', 'word_count': 543, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8b5c5f8d-92bc-59d1-8927-936c96bf4e2f'}, {'abstract': 'What are the chances Axe can actually keep his hand out of the cookie jar?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/01/arts/television/billions-recap-the-wrong-maria-gonzalez.html', 'snippet': 'What are the chances Axe can actually keep his hand out of the cookie jar?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Live like a king. It’s a phrase that connotes wealth, luxury, excess, a life of unlimited possibility and security. How easy it is to let the sparkle of the crown jewels blind us to the dead enemies and discarded undesirables through which they were purchased. This week’s episode of “Billions” reminds us, as bluntly as the show ever has, that the games played by Bobby Axelrod and his billionaire boys club in order to remain comfortable on their thrones can have as steep a cost to bystanders as to any player in the game.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/30/arts/01billions-recap02/01billions-recap02-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 418, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/03/30/arts/01billions-recap02/01billions-recap02-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 418}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/30/arts/01billions-recap02/01billions-recap02-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 714, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/30/arts/01billions-recap02/01billions-recap02-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1428, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/30/arts/01billions-recap02/01billions-recap02-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/03/30/arts/01billions-recap02/01billions-recap02-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/30/arts/01billions-recap02/01billions-recap02-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘Billions’ Season 3, Episode 2 Recap: That Feeling in Your Stomach', 'kicker': 'Billions', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Billions (TV Program)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-04-02T03:00:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Televisio