 than 100 paintings, sculpture and drawings. This was a fraction of the artist’s prodigious output.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/02/arts/design/picasso-tate-modern-london.html', 'snippet': 'Tate Modern focuses on a single year, with more than 100 paintings, sculpture and drawings. This was a fraction of the artist’s prodigious output.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — As the sun set on the last day of 1932, President-elect Franklin D. Roosevelt waited to take office, while American banks continued to buckle. The last chancellor of Weimar Germany sat in a Rococo palace in Berlin; the last emperor of China was installed on a puppet throne in Manchukuo. The globe was agitated, and art was not exempt. The Nazis forced the Bauhaus out of Dessau in 1932, and in the same year the Soviet Union dissolved independent artists’ unions and promulgated the single style of socialist realism.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/03/arts/03picasso-tate1/merlin_135559488_16670030-c484-4c54-8df3-e8b54d95b8c3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 753, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/03/arts/03picasso-tate1/merlin_135559488_16670030-c484-4c54-8df3-e8b54d95b8c3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 753}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/03/arts/03picasso-tate1/merlin_135559488_16670030-c484-4c54-8df3-e8b54d95b8c3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 816, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/03/arts/03picasso-tate1/merlin_135559488_16670030-c484-4c54-8df3-e8b54d95b8c3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1632, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop