/62c43733-319e-5aca-b725-e668c86e49bd', 'word_count': 795, 'uri': 'nyt://article/62c43733-319e-5aca-b725-e668c86e49bd'}, {'abstract': 'You don’t have to like Amazon to fear Trump’s attack on it.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/02/opinion/trump-autocrat-playbook.html', 'snippet': 'You don’t have to like Amazon to fear Trump’s attack on it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In 2009, Turkey’s tax ministry imposed a $2.5 billion fine for alleged tax evasion on Dogan Yayin, a media conglomerate whose newspapers and television stations were critical of the Turkish leader Recep Tayyip Erdogan. Under financial and political pressure, the company began unloading some assets and closing others. Last month, the billionaire Aydin Dogan sold his remaining media properties, including the influential Hurriyet newspaper and CNN Turk, to a group of Erdogan loyalists.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/03/opinion/03Goldberg-web/merlin_136310949_61c7614f-896e-410f-952a-a27dd30d4dae-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/03/opinion/03Goldberg-web/merlin_136310949_61c7614f-896e-410f-952a-a27dd30d4dae-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/03/opinion/03Goldberg-web/merlin_136310949_61c7614f-896e-410f-952a-a27dd30d4dae-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/03/opinion/03Goldberg-web/merlin_136310949_61c7614f-896e-410f-952a-a27dd30d4dae-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy'