ooting — and being shot — cities are focusing on those most at risk.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/03/opinion/gun-violence-personal-deterrence.html', 'snippet': 'Urban gun violence is driven by a very small group of people. To keep them from shooting — and being shot — cities are focusing on those most at risk.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A month ago on a college campus in Newburgh, N.Y., an unusual group gathered to talk about gun violence: community leaders, social service providers, the police chief, the district attorney, a staff member of the United States attorney’s office — and 11 of the most dangerous individuals in Newburgh.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/03/opinion/03FIXEStinarosenbergWEB1/merlin_136311408_ce95b73f-2ad2-4875-967e-c33803ba44ee-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 451, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/03/opinion/03FIXEStinarosenbergWEB1/merlin_136311408_ce95b73f-2ad2-4875-967e-c33803ba44ee-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 451}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/03/opinion/03FIXEStinarosenbergWEB1/merlin_136311408_ce95b73f-2ad2-4875-967e-c33803ba44ee-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 769, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/03/opinion/03FIXEStinarosenbergWEB1/merlin_136311408_ce95b73f-2ad2-4875-967e-c33803ba44ee-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1538, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/03/opinion/03FIXEStinarosenbergWEB1/03FIXEStinarosenbergWEB1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'wid