r first work written for the orchestra.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/04/arts/music/anna-thorvaldsdottir-metacosmos-new-york-philharmonic.html', 'snippet': 'Listen to Anna Thorvaldsdottir’s favorite passage from “Metacosmos,” her first work written for the orchestra.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Anna Thorvaldsdottir’s music conjures landscapes and ecosystems, often inspired by the wild power of nature in Iceland, her home country. But her latest work, “Metacosmos,” takes aim at something even bigger: the might and mystery of celestial bodies.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/05/arts/05metacosmos2/merlin_136329825_5f58c098-e3c4-4fed-b6b4-ed6c155be845-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/05/arts/05metacosmos2/merlin_136329825_5f58c098-e3c4-4fed-b6b4-ed6c155be845-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/05/arts/05metacosmos2/merlin_136329825_5f58c098-e3c4-4fed-b6b4-ed6c155be845-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/05/arts/05metacosmos2/merlin_136329825_5f58c098-e3c4-4fed-b6b4-ed6c155be845-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/05/arts/05metacosmos2/05metacosmos2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/04/05/arts/05metacosmos2/05metacos