ae-b1ce-702e9bcd49bf'}, {'abstract': 'The “Melodrama” tour brings the singer’s scarred and ecstatic songs into arenas reserved for polished pop. But she doesn’t leave her complexities behind.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/05/arts/music/lorde-melodrama-tour-live-review.html', 'snippet': 'The “Melodrama” tour brings the singer’s scarred and ecstatic songs into arenas reserved for polished pop. But she doesn’t leave her complexities behind.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Success has a way of polishing out rough edges, of dulling eccentricities. It is hard work, and it requires a commitment to, and belief in, consistency. On an arena tour, it demands a certain sameness — the version delivered each night should be uniform, whether in Helsinki or Omaha.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/06/arts/06LORDE1/merlin_136418055_613b5a43-7f4f-43b4-873a-ee9093423db6-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/06/arts/06LORDE1/merlin_136418055_613b5a43-7f4f-43b4-873a-ee9093423db6-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/06/arts/06LORDE1/merlin_136418055_613b5a43-7f4f-43b4-873a-ee9093423db6-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/06/arts/06LORDE1/merlin_136418055_613b5a43-7f4f-43b4-873a-ee9093423db6-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/06/arts/06LORDE1/06LO