torches — become everyday occurrences. The worst, the very worst, is coming. But getting there will take years, and life must be lived every day.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/06/arts/06neue1/merlin_136165428_5984e531-c94e-4939-8160-6d9b1eb918c3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 755, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/06/arts/06neue1/merlin_136165428_5984e531-c94e-4939-8160-6d9b1eb918c3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 755}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/06/arts/06neue1/merlin_136165428_5984e531-c94e-4939-8160-6d9b1eb918c3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 814, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/06/arts/06neue1/merlin_136165428_5984e531-c94e-4939-8160-6d9b1eb918c3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1628, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/06/arts/06neue1/06neue1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/04/06/arts/06neue1/06neue1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/06/arts/06neue1/06neue1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Walk Through This Exhibition With Dread. You Know Where It Leads.', 'kicker': 'Art Review', 'content_kicker': None, 