n fraught situations.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/05/nyregion/brooklyn-police-shooting-saheed-vassell.html', 'snippet': 'A shooting in Brooklyn laid bare a shortcoming of neighborhood policing: Officers who know residents are not always the ones responding in fraught situations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'He strode up and down a busy Brooklyn street on Wednesday, lunging at passers-by — someone pushing a cart, someone holding a young child’s hand — with a curved silver pipe resting on his fingers like the barrel of a gun.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Locals Knew He Was Mentally Ill. The Officers Who Shot Him Did Not.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Locals Knew He Was Mentally Ill. Officers Who Shot Him Didn’t.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vassell, Saheed (d 2018)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality, Misconduct and Shootings', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blacks', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black People', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'de Blasio, Bill', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mental Health and Disorders', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Crown Heights (Brooklyn, NY)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-04-06T00:41:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Benjamin Mueller, Jan Ransom and Luis Ferré-Sadurní', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Benjamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mueller', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Jan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ransom', 'qualifier