18 Masters tournament was set when the defending champion, Sergio García, hit five balls into the pond in front of the 15th hole for an eventual eight-over-par 13. It matched the highest score ever recorded on any hole at the Masters, which began in 1934.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/06/sports/06masters-finau/merlin_136440459_82cbefd9-33e9-40aa-84d0-547ccb48e1fc-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/06/sports/06masters-finau/merlin_136440459_82cbefd9-33e9-40aa-84d0-547ccb48e1fc-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/06/sports/06masters-finau/merlin_136440459_82cbefd9-33e9-40aa-84d0-547ccb48e1fc-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 679, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/06/sports/06masters-finau/merlin_136440459_82cbefd9-33e9-40aa-84d0-547ccb48e1fc-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1358, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/06/sports/06masters-finau/06masters-finau-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/04/06/sports/06masters-finau/06masters-finau-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/06/sports/06masters-finau/06masters-finau-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'su