a'}, {'abstract': 'David Steinberg broadens our horizons with an extra large grid.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/05/crosswords/daily-puzzle-2018-04-06.html', 'snippet': 'David Steinberg broadens our horizons with an extra large grid.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FRIDAY PUZZLE — When I first started solving crossword puzzles, I was intimidated by the wide open grids with stacks. Stacks are those entries that stretch all or most of the way across the grid on top of each other — three long entries on top of one another would be a triple stack, for example — and to me they felt impossible to solve. Too much white space to be filled in, for one thing. Then there was the fact that they mostly appear late in the week and the clues were not as helpful as they were in the early week puzzles.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/06/crosswords/06wordplay-pizza/merlin_128276771_704e8e52-5224-4f0f-bc28-add75c59ab56-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/06/crosswords/06wordplay-pizza/merlin_128276771_704e8e52-5224-4f0f-bc28-add75c59ab56-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/06/crosswords/06wordplay-pizza/merlin_128276771_704e8e52-5224-4f0f-bc28-add75c59ab56-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/06/crosswords/06wordplay-pizza/merlin_128276771_704e8e52-5224-4f0f-bc28-add75c59ab56-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 