 skip the White House Correspondents Association Dinner.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/06/us/politics/trump-white-house-correspondents-dinner.html', 'snippet': 'The White House announced on Friday that for the second year in a row, President Trump will skip the White House Correspondents Association Dinner.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Trump will not attend the White House Correspondents Association Dinner this year, continuing a boycott that began his first year in office, the White House announced on Friday, but the president will “actively encourage” members of his administration to go in celebration of the First Amendment.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/07/us/07dc-dinner/merlin_136439184_41fabe11-f94a-4146-a215-d437e5a2935c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/07/us/07dc-dinner/merlin_136439184_41fabe11-f94a-4146-a215-d437e5a2935c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/07/us/07dc-dinner/merlin_136439184_41fabe11-f94a-4146-a215-d437e5a2935c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/07/us/07dc-dinner/merlin_136439184_41fabe11-f94a-4146-a215-d437e5a2935c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/07/us/07dc-dinner/merlin_136439184_41fabe11-f94a-4146-a215-d437e5a2935c-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 