bf2a', 'word_count': 773, 'uri': 'nyt://article/61dcbb25-afc3-56e1-9d85-03a5f609bf2a'}, {'abstract': 'Asparagus has a short season and high esteem among cooks. Set off its delicate flavor with classic ingredients and bursts of tanginess.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/06/dining/asparagus-recipes-ottolenghi.html', 'snippet': 'Asparagus has a short season and high esteem among cooks. Set off its delicate flavor with classic ingredients and bursts of tanginess.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In Britain, where I live, asparagus is a god among vegetables. It is greeted with real reverence in spring, as if nothing worth eating has been available for months. With a deep sigh of relief at the end of a long winter of roots, cabbages and more roots, we finally spot those fresh green shoots, and everybody is happy.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/11/dining/11ottolenghi1/11ottolenghi1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/11/dining/11ottolenghi1/11ottolenghi1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/11/dining/11ottolenghi1/11ottolenghi1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/11/dining/11ottolenghi1/11ottolenghi1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/11/dining/11ottolenghi1/11ottolenghi1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 