42-a651-4e953560f790'}, {'abstract': 'His fallibility makes him appealing after all those years of perfection.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/06/opinion/tiger-woods-masters-tournament.html', 'snippet': 'His fallibility makes him appealing after all those years of perfection.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Like a lot of golfers, I’m rooting for Tiger Woods this weekend, even though I don’t really expect him to win another Masters. He was 1-over at the end of the first round, seven shots off the lead. But that he’s there at all seems a near miracle. This is the same Tiger Woods who not so very long ago was playing in agonizing pain, spraying the ball all over the place, flubbing his chip shots, misjudging his putts. He’s 42 years old now, he’s losing his hair, his knees ache, he’s had so many spine surgeries his back must look as if he’s had a zipper installed.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/07/opinion/07sportingWeb/merlin_136384590_2dc078a4-9cec-4b9f-ad9e-3a1125faed1c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 428, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/07/opinion/07sportingWeb/merlin_136384590_2dc078a4-9cec-4b9f-ad9e-3a1125faed1c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 428}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/07/opinion/07sportingWeb/merlin_136384590_2dc078a4-9cec-4b9f-ad9e-3a1125faed1c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 731, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/07/opinion/07sportingWeb/merlin_136384590_2dc078a4-9cec-4b9f-ad9e-3a1125faed1c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1462, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'th