/article/0d0bb304-4485-5297-84ae-737985d44df3', 'word_count': 894, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0d0bb304-4485-5297-84ae-737985d44df3'}, {'abstract': 'Geoffrey Holder’s repertory staple, lovingly revived by his son and widow, had a sense of majesty.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/08/arts/dance/dougla-review-dance-theater-of-harlem.html', 'snippet': 'Geoffrey Holder’s repertory staple, lovingly revived by his son and widow, had a sense of majesty.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The enthusiastic applause for Dance Theater of Harlem’s revival of “Dougla,” at the New York City Center on Friday, started as soon as the curtain rose. The opening image was of a stage full of proudly posed men and women, all in floor-length skirts decorated with little red pom-poms. More of those pom-poms crowned their heads like rooster combs.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/09/arts/09dancetheaterharlem1/merlin_136433796_6ce05f22-c49f-473c-a97d-dacb76449f5e-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/09/arts/09dancetheaterharlem1/merlin_136433796_6ce05f22-c49f-473c-a97d-dacb76449f5e-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/09/arts/09dancetheaterharlem1/merlin_136433796_6ce05f22-c49f-473c-a97d-dacb76449f5e-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/09/arts/09dancetheaterharlem1/merlin_136433796_6ce05f22-c49f-473c-a97d-dacb76449f5e-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 's