emical weapons persist.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/08/world/middleeast/syria-chemical-attacks-assad.html', 'snippet': 'In 2013, President Bashar al-Assad agreed to dismantle Syria’s chemical weapons stockpile. Five years later, attacks using chemical weapons persist.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Nearly five years after the government of President Bashar al-Assad agreed to purge Syria’s chemical weapons stockpile, the chemical warfare shows no sign of ending as Syria’s bloody civil war stretches into its seventh year.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/09/world/09chemical-Attack-span/merlin_136555437_4adab44a-89a3-4cbb-a7cd-02b73cc6eb86-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 383, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/09/world/09chemical-Attack-span/merlin_136555437_4adab44a-89a3-4cbb-a7cd-02b73cc6eb86-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 383}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/09/world/09chemical-Attack-span/merlin_136555437_4adab44a-89a3-4cbb-a7cd-02b73cc6eb86-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 654, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/09/world/09chemical-Attack-span/merlin_136555437_4adab44a-89a3-4cbb-a7cd-02b73cc6eb86-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1309, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/09/world/09chemical-Attack-span/09chemical-Attack-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/04/09/world/09chemical-Attack-span/09ch