sive stereotype. It was unsatisfying to many.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/09/arts/television/the-simpsons-responds-to-criticism-about-apu.html', 'snippet': 'On Sunday night’s “Simpsons,” the writers finally responded to criticism that its character of Apu is an offensive stereotype. It was unsatisfying to many.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At the end of 2017, Hank Azaria, the voice behind Apu Nahasapeemapetilon, a convenience-store owner on “The Simpsons” with a thick Indian accent, responded to a recent groundswell of criticism that the character was racist. It came to the forefront thanks to Hari Kondabolu, a comedian of South Asian descent, who made a documentary, “The Problem With Apu,” which debuted last fall.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/10/arts/10simpsons-apu-item/merlin_130087926_9200e27f-5b77-4dda-9f30-d32d9462494c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 727, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/10/arts/10simpsons-apu-item/merlin_130087926_9200e27f-5b77-4dda-9f30-d32d9462494c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 727}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/10/arts/10simpsons-apu-item/merlin_130087926_9200e27f-5b77-4dda-9f30-d32d9462494c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 846, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/10/arts/10simpsons-apu-item/merlin_130087926_9200e27f-5b77-4dda-9f30-d32d9462494c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1691, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/10/art