lso be responsible for enabling last weekend’s chemical attack. “Everybody’s going to pay a price,” he said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/09/world/middleeast/trump-syria-attack.html', 'snippet': 'The president said Syria’s patrons in Russia and Iran may also be responsible for enabling last weekend’s chemical attack. “Everybody’s going to pay a price,” he said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Trump said Monday that he might seek to hold accountable not just Syria but its patrons in Russia and Iran for a chemical weapons attack that killed dozens of people outside Damascus over the weekend, a move that could widen a geopolitical conflict already roiling the Middle East.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'After Chemical Weapons Attack in Syria, Trump Weighs Retaliation', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'President Talks Of Retaliation Beyond Syria', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Douma (Syria)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Biological and Chemical Warfare', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Assad, Bashar al-', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Security Council (UN)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bolton, John R', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date