orts of a chemical weapons attack would have little effect. The third could be disastrous.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/10/world/middleeast/syria-us-chemical-weapons.html', 'snippet': 'Two of the ways the United States could respond to fresh reports of a chemical weapons attack would have little effect. The third could be disastrous.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Chemical weapons are again suspected to have been used in Syria, apparently by government forces, circumstantial evidence suggests. Again, many Americans, particularly in Washington, have responded with calls to do something. And, again, punitive airstrikes against the Syrian government are the most discussed option.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/11/world/middleeast/11int-syria/merlin_136658133_d8be50f3-d830-46a3-9aa3-09a99a159aae-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 391, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/11/world/middleeast/11int-syria/merlin_136658133_d8be50f3-d830-46a3-9aa3-09a99a159aae-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 391}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/11/world/middleeast/11int-syria/merlin_136658133_d8be50f3-d830-46a3-9aa3-09a99a159aae-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 668, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/11/world/middleeast/11int-syria/merlin_136658133_d8be50f3-d830-46a3-9aa3-09a99a159aae-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1304, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/11/world/middleeast/11int-syria/11int-syria-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height':