ew movie “Beirut.” But nuanced depictions of Lebanon and its people exist. Here’s what to watch and read.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/10/movies/beirut-movie-books.html', 'snippet': 'Many people bristled at the new movie “Beirut.” But nuanced depictions of Lebanon and its people exist. Here’s what to watch and read.', 'lead_paragraph': 'From 1975 to 1990, the world watched as Beirut was decimated by a complex, sectarian civil war that left, by some estimates, 150,000 people dead and a million Lebanese displaced. In the years since, the word “Beirut” has become shorthand for war zone, bombings, devastation.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/22/arts/22beirut-sidebar1/22beirut-sidebar1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/22/arts/22beirut-sidebar1/22beirut-sidebar1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/22/arts/22beirut-sidebar1/22beirut-sidebar1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/22/arts/22beirut-sidebar1/22beirut-sidebar1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/22/arts/22beirut-sidebar1/22beirut-sidebar1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/04/22/arts/22beirut-sidebar1/22beirut-sidebar1-thumbStandard-v2