-louis-nelson.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Collins, a.k.a. Sweet Judy Blue Eyes, and Louis Nelson have been together for 40 years — “very good for an old hippie,” she said.', 'lead_paragraph': '“We were just thinking of all the restaurants that we’ve outlived,” Judy Collins said on a recent afternoon at the Carlyle Hotel in New York. She was there with her husband, Louis Nelson.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/04/fashion/00LOVEIS-collins-1/00LOVEIS-collins-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 396, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/04/fashion/00LOVEIS-collins-1/00LOVEIS-collins-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 396}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/04/fashion/00LOVEIS-collins-1/00LOVEIS-collins-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 676, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/04/fashion/00LOVEIS-collins-1/00LOVEIS-collins-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 983, 'width': 1488, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/04/fashion/00LOVEIS-collins-1/00LOVEIS-collins-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/04/04/fashion/00LOVEIS-collins-1/00LOVEIS-collins-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/04/fashion/00LOVEIS-collins-1/00LOVEIS-collins-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'cr