 a real-life evangelical bishop who began preaching that even people who hadn’t been “saved” would be spared from hell.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/12/movies/come-sunday-review-chiwetel-ejiofor.html', 'snippet': 'The film tells the story of a real-life evangelical bishop who began preaching that even people who hadn’t been “saved” would be spared from hell.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If Ingmar Bergman and Robert Bresson gave us priests who feared the absence of God, “Come Sunday” offers the opposite: the story of a real-life evangelical bishop who began preaching that God was welcoming, and that even people who hadn’t been “saved” would be spared from hell. That message might seem innocuous, but it challenged the beliefs of the congregants at his Tulsa megachurch, who regarded the position as heresy.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/13/arts/13comesunday1/comesunday1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 372, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/13/arts/13comesunday1/comesunday1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 372}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/13/arts/13comesunday1/comesunday1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 636, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/13/arts/13comesunday1/comesunday1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1271, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/13/arts/13comesunday1/comesunday1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'cro