arely has her girlhood been given a credible cinematic imagining. She was put to death at 19, and most of the actors who have played the saint were well above that age. Most famously, Ingrid Bergman was 32 when she portrayed the 16-to-19-year-old Joan in a 1948 film. So it’s salutary that, with “Jeannette: The Childhood of Joan of Arc,” the writer and director Bruno Dumont casts two genuinely young performers to play Joan at key stages of her life.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/13/movies/13jeannette1/merlin_136485513_2fc7d0c3-9525-48dd-b157-dd673b3926a0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 337, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/13/movies/13jeannette1/merlin_136485513_2fc7d0c3-9525-48dd-b157-dd673b3926a0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 337}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/13/movies/13jeannette1/merlin_136485513_2fc7d0c3-9525-48dd-b157-dd673b3926a0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/13/movies/13jeannette1/merlin_136485513_2fc7d0c3-9525-48dd-b157-dd673b3926a0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/13/movies/13jeannette1/13jeannette1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/04/13/movies/13jeannette1/13jeannette1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thum