 human being. This is someone whose long career as a model, actress and undervalued musician has veered, sometimes uncomfortably, into both the sub- and superhuman. So the relief of “Grace Jones: Bloodlight and Bami” is that it seeks to square the person with the provocateuse.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/13/arts/13gracejones/merlin_136485483_afb2aab0-3b35-4b40-a739-eb24d876b3e9-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 364, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/13/arts/13gracejones/merlin_136485483_afb2aab0-3b35-4b40-a739-eb24d876b3e9-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 364}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/13/arts/13gracejones/merlin_136485483_afb2aab0-3b35-4b40-a739-eb24d876b3e9-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 621, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/13/arts/13gracejones/merlin_136485483_afb2aab0-3b35-4b40-a739-eb24d876b3e9-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1242, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/13/arts/13gracejones/13gracejones-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/04/13/arts/13gracejones/13gracejones-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/13/arts/13gracejones/13gracejones-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 