ri.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/13/us/eric-greitens-missouri-scandal.html', 'snippet': 'A look at how a governor’s affair led to political upheaval and a legal battle in Missouri.', 'lead_paragraph': 'First came a public admission from Gov. Eric Greitens of Missouri that he had been unfaithful to his wife. What followed was a dizzying series of events: calls for his resignation, a criminal indictment, lawmakers conducting an investigation, and, this week, release of a report filled with graphic and troubling details.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/14/us/politics/14greitens-sub/merlin_117780452_3365b9ac-20b3-4850-b318-93aed6432c60-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/14/us/politics/14greitens-sub/merlin_117780452_3365b9ac-20b3-4850-b318-93aed6432c60-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/14/us/politics/14greitens-sub/merlin_117780452_3365b9ac-20b3-4850-b318-93aed6432c60-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/14/us/politics/14greitens-sub/merlin_117780452_3365b9ac-20b3-4850-b318-93aed6432c60-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/14/us/politics/14greitens-sub/merlin_117780452_3365b9ac-20b3-4850-b318-93aed6432c60-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legac