3d'}, {'abstract': 'A warning about fascism both abroad and at home.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/13/opinion/madeleine-albright-worried-trump.html', 'snippet': 'A warning about fascism both abroad and at home.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Madeleine Albright, the former secretary of state, was born into a totalitarian age. She was only a toddler when she and her parents, who were of Jewish descent but later converted to Catholicism, fled Czechoslovakia after Hitler’s invasion in 1939. They returned following the war, but fled again in the wake of the Communist coup in 1948.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/13/opinion/13goldbergWeb/merlin_136761066_c95be4b4-780f-4979-916a-aa19e0c5c51f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/13/opinion/13goldbergWeb/merlin_136761066_c95be4b4-780f-4979-916a-aa19e0c5c51f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/13/opinion/13goldbergWeb/merlin_136761066_c95be4b4-780f-4979-916a-aa19e0c5c51f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/13/opinion/13goldbergWeb/merlin_136761066_c95be4b4-780f-4979-916a-aa19e0c5c51f-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/13/opinion/13goldbergWeb/13goldbergWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/04/13/opinion/13goldbergWeb/