n, Sarah Vowell and Samuel L. Jackson are back in the sequel to the 2004 original.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two months after releasing a sneak peek of “Incredibles 2,” Disney and Pixar have unleashed the animated sequel’s first full trailer. Although the original film came out in 2004, the superhero family hasn’t aged — Jack-Jack is still an infant — but it is showing signs of growing pains.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘Incredibles 2’ Trailer: When a Superhero Is Also a Working Mom', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jackson, Samuel L', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nelson, Craig T', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hunter, Holly', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bird, Brad', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Incredibles 2 (Movie)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-04-13T15:35:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bruce Fretts', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bruce', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fretts', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c8f4faa2-6a36-5b84-a319-41a76ef16e1f', 'word_count': 169, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c8f4faa2-6a36-5b84-a319-41a76ef16e1f'}, {'abstract': 'Party leaders should approach the midterm elections under the banner of an ambitious program to bring economic revival to the working class.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/13/opinion/sunday/trump-republican-new-deal.html', 'snippet': 'Party leaders should approach the midterm elections under the banner of an ambitious program to bring economic revival to the wor