ec5-4ef8-5e8f-b056-a129d8037425'}, {'abstract': 'Lynn Nottage’s beautiful, reverberating portrait of a murder and its consequences follows the global path of illicitly obtained ivory.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/15/theater/mlimas-tale-review-lynn-nottage.html', 'snippet': 'Lynn Nottage’s beautiful, reverberating portrait of a murder and its consequences follows the global path of illicitly obtained ivory.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Those of you who don’t believe in ghosts are likely to think again after seeing “Mlima’s Tale,” Lynn Nottage’s beautiful, endlessly echoing portrait of a murder and its afterlife. In this taut, elegantly assembled production, which opened on Sunday night at the Public Theater, a magnificent specter stalks this planet, contaminating the lives of everyone he encounters.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/16/arts/16mlimastale3/merlin_136076805_d852b08c-0f9c-43d8-9d22-f5e14243a2a4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 408, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/16/arts/16mlimastale3/merlin_136076805_d852b08c-0f9c-43d8-9d22-f5e14243a2a4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 408}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/16/arts/16mlimastale3/merlin_136076805_d852b08c-0f9c-43d8-9d22-f5e14243a2a4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 695, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/16/arts/16mlimastale3/merlin_136076805_d852b08c-0f9c-43d8-9d22-f5e14243a2a4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1391, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'c