s.com/2018/04/16/opinion/white-racism-threats.html', 'snippet': 'The racial hatred I experienced almost broke my spirit. But I found some light in the darkness.', 'lead_paragraph': 'You deserve to be punished with several fists to your face! You’re nothing but a troublemaker! I’ve had enough of your Racist talk! You’d better watch what you say and to whom you say it! You may just end up in the hospital with several injuries or maybe on a cold slab in the local morgue! You’ve got a big mouth that needs to be slammed shut permanently!', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/16/opinion/16stoneWeb/merlin_136792185_383d9fd8-0c67-48d6-b45b-40574ca2e57c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 407, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/16/opinion/16stoneWeb/merlin_136792185_383d9fd8-0c67-48d6-b45b-40574ca2e57c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 407}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/16/opinion/16stoneWeb/merlin_136792185_383d9fd8-0c67-48d6-b45b-40574ca2e57c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 694, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/16/opinion/16stoneWeb/merlin_136792185_383d9fd8-0c67-48d6-b45b-40574ca2e57c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1388, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/16/opinion/16stoneWeb/16stoneWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/04/16/opinion/16stoneWeb/16stoneWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight':