los” in four cities.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/16/arts/dance/merce-cunningham-centennial-plans-announced.html', 'snippet': 'The events, beginning in the fall, will involve companies from around the world, including rarities and a “Night of 100 Solos” in four cities.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Merce Cunningham Trust announced Monday, on what would have been Cunningham’s 99th birthday, a global centennial celebration of his legacy, beginning this fall. More than 60 presenting organizations and dance companies from around the world are expected to participate, and the Royal Ballet in London will be one of several to tackle Cunningham for the first time.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/17/arts/17cunningham-item/merlin_136900257_ab3b5c94-562b-41ec-8bfc-53428ed9af3e-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 554, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/17/arts/17cunningham-item/merlin_136900257_ab3b5c94-562b-41ec-8bfc-53428ed9af3e-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 554}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/17/arts/17cunningham-item/merlin_136900257_ab3b5c94-562b-41ec-8bfc-53428ed9af3e-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 946, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/17/arts/17cunningham-item/merlin_136900257_ab3b5c94-562b-41ec-8bfc-53428ed9af3e-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1511, 'width': 1636, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/17/arts/17cunningham-item/17cunningham-item--thumbStandard.jpg', 'height