ork Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/17/arts/17wandajune2/merlin_136800153_001cf9f0-134b-4e0c-ab22-530962454ba4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/17/arts/17wandajune2/merlin_136800153_001cf9f0-134b-4e0c-ab22-530962454ba4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/17/arts/17wandajune2/merlin_136800153_001cf9f0-134b-4e0c-ab22-530962454ba4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/17/arts/17wandajune2/merlin_136800153_001cf9f0-134b-4e0c-ab22-530962454ba4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/17/arts/17wandajune2/17wandajune2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/04/17/arts/17wandajune2/17wandajune2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/17/arts/17wandajune2/17wandajune2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: Toxic Masculinity, Vonnegut Style, in ‘Happy Birthday, Wanda June’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Feral Bully Unleashes  Comic Storm', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Happy Birthday, Wanda June (Play)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Frankel, Gene, Theater', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vonnegut, Kurt Jr', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wise, Jeff (Theater Director)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'MacCluggage, Kate', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': "O'Connell, Jason (Actor)", 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Wheelhouse Theater Co', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-04-16T17:39:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Theater', 'byline': {'original': 'By Laura Collins-Hughes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Laura', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Collins-Hughes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/fd07c19c-92b9-54b4-a548-d6de3fcb8d23', 'word_count': 645, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fd07c19c-92b9-54b4-a548-d6de3fcb8d23'}, {'abstract': 'The Brooklyn-based Oaxacan restaurant uses its own brand of mezcal in its gelato.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/16/dining/gelato-mezcal-claro-restaurant.html', 'snippet': 'The Brooklyn-based Oaxacan restaurant uses its own brand of mezcal in its gelato.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It makes sense for a restaurant that specializes in the food of Oaxaca to feature mezcal, the smoky agave-based spirit that dominates the region. At Claro in Brooklyn, T. J. Steele, the chef and an owner of the restaurant, also has a brand of mezcal, El Buho. He has worked with Il Laboratorio del Gelato in Manhattan to create four gelatos flavored with El Buho. Most are named for the type of agave used to make the spirit, like Espadin, the mildest, and Tepeztate, with the smokiest flavor. Tobala and Añejo are the others, all subtly different: $4.50 for two scoops at Il Laboratorio del Gelato stores; a flight of all four varieties, with oranges, $10, at Claro, 284 Third Avenue (President Street), Gowanus, Brooklyn, 347-721-3146, clarobk.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/18/dining/18burnergelato/merlin_136181046_11a0ee0f-d392-48cc-87dc-165f75578fe5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/18/dining/18burnergelato/merlin_136181046_11a0ee0f-d392-48cc-87dc-165f75578fe5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/18/dining/18burnergelato/merlin_136181046_11a0ee0f-d392-48cc-87dc-165f75578fe5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/18/dining/18burnergelato/merlin_136181046_11a0ee0f-d392-48cc-87dc-165f75578fe5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/18/dining/18burnergelato/18burnergelato-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/04/18/dining/18burnergelato/18burnergelato-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/18/dining/18burnergelato/18burnergelato-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Even the Gelato Is Infused With Mezcal at Claro', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Scoop: Even the Gelato  Is Infused With Mezcal', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Claro (Brooklyn, NY, Restaurant)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Steele, T J', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Il Laboratorio del Gelato (Manhattan, NY, Restaurant)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ice Cream and Frozen Desserts', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-04-16T17:39:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4e761cab-131d-53e8-b2a1-b47a4a3f3774', 'word_count': 150, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4e761cab-131d-53e8-b2a1-b47a4a3f3774'}, {'abstract': 'A cast iron piece from Finex facilitates pouring and cleans up easily.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/16/dining/dutch-oven-cast-iron-cookware-finex.html', 'snippet': 'A cast iron piece from Finex facilitates pouring and cleans up easily.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Cast-iron cookware is in the spotlight. Having started with skillets, producers are now introducing Dutch ovens. Despite already owning pots from Staub and Le Creuset, I could not resist the new Dutch oven by Finex Cast Iron Cookware, an American company that makes distinctive octagonal pieces with a dark bronze finish. The brass knob on the lid bears my initials (they happen to coincide with the company logo). It was fine for a test-drive pot roast, snugly holding a four-pound piece of chuck. The angled shape, meant to facilitate pouring, proved effective, and clean-up, thanks to its pre-seasoned organic flaxseed oil coating, was a breeze. You just need a few sessions at the gym to lift its nearly 12 pounds (empty): Finex 5-Quart Dutch Oven With Cover, $300, finexusa.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/18/dining/18burnerdutch/merlin_136490733_ee8c8102-017b-4fd6-9606-806931b2f049-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 438, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/18/dining/18burnerdutch/merlin_136490733_ee8c8102-017b-4fd6-9606-806931b2f049-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 438}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/18/dining/18burnerdutch/merlin_136490733_ee8c8102-017b-4fd6-9606-806931b2f049-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 748, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/18/dining/18burnerdutch/merlin_136490733_ee8c8102-017b-4fd6-9606-806931b2f049-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1496, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/18/dining/18burnerdutch/18burnerdutch-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/04/18/dining/18burnerdutch/18burnerdutch-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/18/dining/18burnerdutch/18burnerdutch-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Get a Workout With a New Dutch Oven', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Braise: New Dutch Oven Provides a Workout', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cookware', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Finex Cast Iron Cookware Co', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-04-16T17:43:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e4da1854-42fc-579e-ba86-86a93f30f5f9', 'word_count': 152, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e4da1854-42fc-579e-ba86-86a93f30f5f9'}, {'abstract': '“Julep: Southern Cocktails Refashioned” has recipes for drinks of the South, including the mint julep, in time for Derby Day.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/16/dining/drinks/mint-julep-book.html', 'snippet': '“Julep: Southern Cocktails Refashioned” has recipes for drinks of the South, including the mint julep, in time for Derby Day.', 'lead_paragraph': 'You may have a drink recipe that gets an annual workout as the thoroughbreds walk to the gate. But if you don’t — and even if you do — you might want to saunter through “Julep,” a new guide by Alba Huerta, who owns a bar called Julep in Houston. The book begins with the drink itself and its history. In the South, it was enjoyed by the moneyed crowd equipped with silver julep cups. The book goes on to cover cocktails that have Southern roots like Ramos gin fizz and milk punch. The drink recipes often call for turbinado syrup, made with granulated light brown sugar, a component worth having even for Northern cocktails. Recipes for bar snacks take you through deviled eggs and pimento cheese: “Julep: Southern Cocktails Refashioned” by Alba Huerta (Lorena Jones Books, $24.99).', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/18/dining/18burnerjulep/merlin_136393347_abf41026-f3ec-4269-90e4-742b6c7dda79-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/18/dining/18burnerjulep/merlin_136393347_abf41026-f3ec-4269-90e4-742b6c7dda79-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 768}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/18/dining/18burnerjulep/merlin_136393347_abf41026-f3ec-4269-90e4-742b6c7dda79-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 801, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/18/dining/18burnerjulep/merlin_136393347_abf41026-f3ec-4269-90e4-742b6c7dda79-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1601, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/18/dining/18burnerjulep/18burnerjulep-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/04/18/dining/18burnerjulep/18burnerjulep-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/18/dining/18burnerjulep/18burnerjulep-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Favorite in a 