in order to establish the right of Council members to file amicus briefs in court cases.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/17/nyregion/nyc-council-mayor-lawsuit.html', 'snippet': 'The New York City Council is suing the city’s Law Department in order to establish the right of Council members to file amicus briefs in court cases.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The New York City Council opened a new front in its effort to assert its independence from the administration of Mayor Bill de Blasio, bringing a lawsuit against the city’s Law Department in order to establish the right of Council members to file amicus briefs in court cases.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'No Friends of the Court: City Council Sues City’s Top Lawyer', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'City Council Seeks Right To File Briefs', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation (Civil)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mayors', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'City Council (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Corey', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'de Blasio, Bill', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Law Department (NYC)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-04-17T21:30:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By J. David Goodman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'J.', 'middlename': 'David', 'lastname': 'Goodman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6085f14b-9c25-5777-9ef4-1f54de278a32', 'word_count': 695, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6085f14b-9c25-5777-9ef4-1f54de278a32'}, {'abstract': 'The latest victim to be identified was a 37-year-old man who had arrived in Canada from Sri Lanka in 2010. The Toronto police believe he was killed five years later.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/17/world/americas/bruce-mcarthur-serial-killer.html', 'snippet': 'The latest victim to be identified was a 37-year-old man who had arrived in Canada from Sri Lanka in 2010. The Toronto police believe he was killed five years later.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For more than a month, the police in Toronto have been trying to solve a mystery. They had a photograph of an unidentified dead man, and they had discovered human remains in planters where a man suspected of multiple killings had worked as a landscaper.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/17/world/18xp-killer1/18xp-killer1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/17/world/18xp-killer1/18xp-killer1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/17/world/18xp-killer1/18xp-killer1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/17/world/18xp-killer1/18xp-killer1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/17/world/18xp-killer1/18xp-killer1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/04/17/world/18xp-killer1/1