y have any impact on climate change. I seek judgment from the court regarding the true value of our lifestyle.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/22/magazine/22mag-hodgman/22mag-22hodgman-t_CA0-articleLarge.png', 'height': 603, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/22/magazine/22mag-hodgman/22mag-22hodgman-t_CA0-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 603}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/22/magazine/22mag-hodgman/22mag-22hodgman-t_CA0-jumbo.png', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1020, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/22/magazine/22mag-hodgman/22mag-22hodgman-t_CA0-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1287, 'width': 1281, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/22/magazine/22mag-hodgman/22mag-22hodgman-t_CA0-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/04/22/magazine/22mag-hodgman/22mag-22hodgman-t_CA0-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/22/magazine/22mag-hodgman/22mag-22hodgman-t_CA0-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Judge John Hodgman on the True Value of Tiny Homes', 'kicker': 'Judge John Hodgman', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bonus Advice From Judge John Hodgman'