iked mayonnaise.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Good morning. I got it into my head to make a fancy grilled cheese sandwich. I didn’t have a recipe because you don’t really need a recipe to make grilled cheese sandwiches, especially in the middle of the week. You just need desire, and a triangle in your head: salt; crunch; melting ooze.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/12/21/dining/21COOKING_PEASOUP2/21COOKING_PEASOUP2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/12/21/dining/21COOKING_PEASOUP2/21COOKING_PEASOUP2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/12/21/dining/21COOKING_PEASOUP2/21COOKING_PEASOUP2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/12/21/dining/21COOKING_PEASOUP2/21COOKING_PEASOUP2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/12/21/dining/21COOKING_PEASOUP2/21COOKING_PEASOUP2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/12/21/dining/21COOKING_PEASOUP2/21COOKING_PEASOUP2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/12/21/dining/21COOKING_PEASOUP2/21COOKING_PEASOUP2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {