, 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By The International Herald Tribune', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The International Herald Tribune'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c193fc98-6e5e-55fa-9c7b-ef1ce34143ab', 'word_count': 211, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c193fc98-6e5e-55fa-9c7b-ef1ce34143ab'}, {'abstract': 'In the Portuguese capital, a weekend’s worth of seafood feasts, chic rooftop bars, undulating streets and landmarks, both Old World and futuristic. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/19/travel/36-hours-in-lisbon.html', 'snippet': 'In the Portuguese capital, a weekend’s worth of seafood feasts, chic rooftop bars, undulating streets and landmarks, both Old World and futuristic. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'Forget Lisbon as the budget capital of Europe. Yes, the seafood is still (relatively) cheap, as is the wine. The old canary-yellow trams still rattle along steep hills, and you’ll never pay more than a euro and change for a pastéis de nata, the classic Portuguese pastry. But today the Portuguese capital is better known for its red-hot culinary scene and fine cultural institutions, including a new world-class museum on the waterfront. The faded Old Europe charm remains, but with a stream of exciting openings and fresh inspiration drawn from across the Atlantic, Lisbon seems primed for a new golden era.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/29/realestate/29Hours-Lisbon-1/merlin_136339584_d97da49f-7913-434c-9530-8333f434be9e-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/29/realestate/29Hours-Lisbon-1/merlin_136339584_d97da49f-7913-434c-9530-8333f434be9e-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/29/realestate/29Hours-Lisbon-1/merlin_136339584_d97da49f-7913-434c-9530-8333f434be9e-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/29/realestate/29Hours-Lisbon-1/merlin_136339584_d97da49f-7913-434c-9530-8333f434be9e-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/29/realestate/29Hours-Lisbon-1/merlin_136339584_d97da49f-7913-434c-9530-8333f434be9e-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/04/29/realestate/29Hours-Lisbon-1/merlin_136339584_d97da49f-7913-434c-9530-8333f434be9e-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/29/realestate/29Hours-Lisbon-1/merlin_136339584_d97da49f-7913-434c-9530-8333f434be9e-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '36 Hours in Lisbon', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Lisbon', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Lisbon (Portugal)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-04-19T09:00:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ingrid K. Williams', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ingrid', 'middlename': 'K.', 'lastname': 'Williams', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7feac833-3660-588e-8c94-2d56b8323fb9', 'word_count': 1570, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7feac833-3660-588e-8c94-2d56b8323fb9'}, {'abstract': 'After hiding behind an alter ego for years, the pop star is ready to step into a more authentic self with ‘Dirty Computer.’', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/19/magazine/how-janelle-monae-found-her-voice.html', 'snippet': 'After hiding behind an alter ego for years, the pop star is ready to step into a more authentic self with ‘Dirty Computer.’', 'lead_paragraph': 'On a hot December afternoon, the sky hazy from wildfires that raged just beyond the Los Angeles city limits, a handful of people gathered outside a nondescript Super 8 motel off Sunset Boulevard. Nearly all were dressed head to toe in black: elegant crepe shirts, fitted leather pants, wide-brimmed hats. The group made their way inside to the Girl at the White Horse, a discreet bar nestled in the space below the motel. Here, the air was still hazy — the synthetic kind, from a machine — and lights tinted the room pink and red, colors of the heart. Low vibrational tones, not unlike those coaxed out of Tibetan singing bowls, droned in the background. Most of the invitees worked for radio stations, record labels or awards shows, and while they waited, they ordered cocktails created for the event: “Pynk” (rosé, gin, aperol and grapefruit) or “Screwed” (pineapple-infused tequila, lime, agave with a touch of pepper).', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/19/magazine/19mag-janelle-image1/19mag-janelle-image1-articleLarge-v10.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/19/magazine/19mag-janelle-image1/19mag-janelle-image1-articleLarge-v10.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/19/magazine/19mag-janelle-image1/19mag-janelle-image1-jumbo-v8.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/19/magazine/19mag-janelle-image1/19mag-janelle-image1-superJumbo-v11.jpg', 'height': 1252, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/19/magazine/19mag-janelle-image1/19mag-janelle-image1-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/04/19/magazine/19mag-janelle-image1/19mag-janelle-image1-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/19/magazine/19mag-janelle-image1/19mag-janelle-image1-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'How Janelle Monáe Found Her Voice', 'kicker': 'feature', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'How Janelle Monáe Found Her Voice', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rap and Hip-Hop', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Monae, Janelle', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Wondaland Records', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Dirty Computer (Album)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-04-19T09:00:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jenna Wortham', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jenna', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wortham', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9af78254-4ac0-549d-9255-f2c7f7ba4908', 'word_count': 6259, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9af78254-4ac0-549d-9255-f2c7f7ba4908'}, {'abstract': 'There’s a sense of wistfulness among aging Cuban exiles in Miami: Cuba will no longer be led by a Castro. But they don’t expect real change anytime soon.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/19/us/raul-castro-florida-cubans.html', 'snippet': 'There’s a sense of wistfulness among aging Cuban exiles in Miami: Cuba will no longer be led by a Castro. But they don’t expect real change anytime soon.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MIAMI — The old Cuban fighters gathered under a cloudless South Florida sky and belted out two national anthems — one for their country a few hundred miles south, the one that gave them life, the other for this country, the one that will probably see their death.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/20/us/20cubans-01/merlin_137010573_63d11abd-c940-4b26-b565-4946751a790c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 465, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/20/us/20cubans-01/merlin_137010573_63d11abd-c940-4b26-b565-4946751a790c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 465}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/20/us/20cubans-01/merlin_137010573_63d11abd-c940-4b26-b565-4946751a790c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 793, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/20/us/20cubans-01/merlin_137010573_63d11abd-c940-4b26-b565-4