-cohen-defamation-lawsuits.html', 'snippet': 'The decision by Michael Cohen to abandon the suits came as federal prosecutors are investigating his efforts to protect Mr. Trump from brewing scandals.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In early January, Michael D. Cohen, President Trump’s personal lawyer, filed a pair of lawsuits claiming that the political research firm Fusion GPS and the website BuzzFeed had defamed him by promoting the so-called Steele dossier, an intelligence report that alleged connections between Mr. Trump’s associates and Russia. The dossier depicted Mr. Cohen as a central figure in what it described as a conspiracy.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/20/nyregion/20cohenlibel/merlin_136947981_39ef67b9-805f-4ffb-bb1b-2ac6f2ea9441-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/20/nyregion/20cohenlibel/merlin_136947981_39ef67b9-805f-4ffb-bb1b-2ac6f2ea9441-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/20/nyregion/20cohenlibel/merlin_136947981_39ef67b9-805f-4ffb-bb1b-2ac6f2ea9441-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/20/nyregion/20cohenlibel/merlin_136947981_39ef67b9-805f-4ffb-bb1b-2ac6f2ea9441-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/20/nyregion/20cohenlibel/20cohenlibel-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail'