 Tankleff, who was convicted as a teenager and imprisoned for 17 years, has reached a settlement with Suffolk County, N.Y.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/20/nyregion/martin-tankleff-settlement.html', 'snippet': 'Martin Tankleff, who was convicted as a teenager and imprisoned for 17 years, has reached a settlement with Suffolk County, N.Y.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Martin Tankleff, who was imprisoned for 17 years after being wrongly convicted of murdering his parents, has reached a $10 million settlement with Suffolk County, N.Y.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/21/business/21xptankleff/merlin_23917713_78f380e5-c19c-4dd3-8e2d-fbbef80f5d64-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/21/business/21xptankleff/merlin_23917713_78f380e5-c19c-4dd3-8e2d-fbbef80f5d64-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/21/business/21xptankleff/merlin_23917713_78f380e5-c19c-4dd3-8e2d-fbbef80f5d64-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/21/business/21xptankleff/merlin_23917713_78f380e5-c19c-4dd3-8e2d-fbbef80f5d64-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/21/business/21xptankleff/merlin_23917713_78f380e5-c19c-4dd3-8e2d-fbbef80f5d64-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/