d906'}, {'abstract': 'Campus free speech is threatened on the left as well as the right.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/20/opinion/the-politically-incorrect-randa-jarrar.html', 'snippet': 'Campus free speech is threatened on the left as well as the right.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Tuesday evening, Randa Jarrar, a creative-writing professor at California State University at Fresno, wrote a series of insensitive and politically incorrect tweets. The next day, amid national outrage, the school’s provost gave a news conference denouncing Jarrar’s “deeply disrespectful statements,” and telling journalists that the “incident is under review.” The Fresno Bee quoted the school’s president, Joseph Castro: “A professor with tenure does not have blanket protection to say and do what they wish.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/20/opinion/20goldbergWeb/20goldbergWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 394, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/20/opinion/20goldbergWeb/20goldbergWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 394}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/20/opinion/20goldbergWeb/20goldbergWeb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 672, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/20/opinion/20goldbergWeb/20goldbergWeb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1344, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/20/opinion/20goldbergWeb/20goldbergWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legac