es with her husband, Dr. Michael Ghalili, 64, a cosmetic dentist who, like Dr. Day, practices in Manhattan, and their dog, Baby, a 12-year-old Havanese. Her mother, Shekoofeh Day, lives in the building too, just two floors away. The couple has two grown children, Sabrina Ghalili, 26, and Andrew Ghalili, 24.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/22/nyregion/22routine1/merlin_136931943_8e439995-ca88-49e6-a454-3613f4e4df56-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/22/nyregion/22routine1/merlin_136931943_8e439995-ca88-49e6-a454-3613f4e4df56-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/22/nyregion/22routine1/merlin_136931943_8e439995-ca88-49e6-a454-3613f4e4df56-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/22/nyregion/22routine1/merlin_136931943_8e439995-ca88-49e6-a454-3613f4e4df56-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/22/nyregion/22routine1/22routine1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/04/22/nyregion/22routine1/22routine1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/22/nyregion/22routine1/22routine1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150,