s respond to a question from the Dear Sugars hotline: Is it O.K. to love someone who abused you?', 'lead_paragraph': '“I fell madly in love with a young man,” begins a voice mail message addressed to the Sugars. It’s how many of the letters to the Sugars begin, but this message takes an alarming turn: “Our arguments had reached a point where they were just straight up nasty. And they’ve gotten to the point where he struck me in my face three times.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/08/22/insider/SUGARS-article-art/SUGARS-article-art-articleLarge-v5.jpg', 'height': 451, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/08/22/insider/SUGARS-article-art/SUGARS-article-art-articleLarge-v5.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 451}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/08/22/insider/SUGARS-article-art/SUGARS-article-art-jumbo-v5.jpg', 'height': 719, 'width': 957, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/08/22/insider/SUGARS-article-art/SUGARS-article-art-superJumbo-v5.jpg', 'height': 719, 'width': 957, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/08/22/insider/SUGARS-article-art/SUGARS-article-art-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/08/22/insider/SUGARS-article-art/SUGARS-article-art-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/08/22/insider/SUGARS-article-art