-53d9-9208-814cad14bd72', 'word_count': 849, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e9c3ef5b-ec42-53d9-9208-814cad14bd72'}, {'abstract': 'To end the worst stagnation in living standards since the Great Depression, the country needs to be bold.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/22/opinion/big-economic-ideas.html', 'snippet': 'To end the worst stagnation in living standards since the Great Depression, the country needs to be bold.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The headlines may talk about growth, but we are living in a dark economic era. For most families, income and wealth have stagnated in recent decades, barely keeping pace with inflation. Nearly all the bounty of the economy’s growth has flowed to the affluent.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/23/opinion/23leonhardtWEB/merlin_136379775_1aa0be75-4e11-4c4d-a4ba-1d949fb52661-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/23/opinion/23leonhardtWEB/merlin_136379775_1aa0be75-4e11-4c4d-a4ba-1d949fb52661-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/23/opinion/23leonhardtWEB/merlin_136379775_1aa0be75-4e11-4c4d-a4ba-1d949fb52661-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/23/opinion/23leonhardtWEB/merlin_136379775_1aa0be75-4e11-4c4d-a4ba-1d949fb52661-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/23/opinion/23leonhardtWEB/23leonhardtWE