 1291, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1d5d6b1c-18d9-57d9-9811-792c19f60e52'}, {'abstract': 'Butler, who grew up 30 minutes outside of Houston, admitted he felt some extra satisfaction in beating the Rockets, his boyhood team, in Game 3.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/22/sports/jimmy-butler-minnesota-timberwolves.html', 'snippet': 'Butler, who grew up 30 minutes outside of Houston, admitted he felt some extra satisfaction in beating the Rockets, his boyhood team, in Game 3.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MINNEAPOLIS — The All-Star forward Jimmy Butler comes across as the proudest former resident in the history of tiny Tomball, Texas. What he doesn’t advertise in his Twitter biography, but also doesn’t dispute, is that he grew up dreaming of becoming a Houston Rocket like his hero Tracy McGrady.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/23/sports/23wolves-web1/merlin_137035476_2da83f37-7afb-4e2f-9942-404e79e0d49e-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 449, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/23/sports/23wolves-web1/merlin_137035476_2da83f37-7afb-4e2f-9942-404e79e0d49e-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 449}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/23/sports/23wolves-web1/merlin_137035476_2da83f37-7afb-4e2f-9942-404e79e0d49e-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 767, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/23/sports/23wolves-web1/merlin_137035476_2da83f37-7afb-4e2f-9942-404e79e0d49e-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1534, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': No