layer in the American League with his call-up to the Yankees on Saturday, had a whirlwind weekend. Now comes the hard part.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The text message startled Austin Romine, in a good way. Before taking the field as the starting catcher on Sunday, Romine heard from a friend that he was the oldest player in the Yankees’ lineup. Back in the clubhouse later, Romine shook his head and smiled. It was not long ago that he was the young guy, surrounded by veterans.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/23/sports/23kepnerweb1/merlin_137184903_10fcb9ff-a473-4bd1-a00e-c8ab9ed50250-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/23/sports/23kepnerweb1/merlin_137184903_10fcb9ff-a473-4bd1-a00e-c8ab9ed50250-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/23/sports/23kepnerweb1/merlin_137184903_10fcb9ff-a473-4bd1-a00e-c8ab9ed50250-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/23/sports/23kepnerweb1/merlin_137184903_10fcb9ff-a473-4bd1-a00e-c8ab9ed50250-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/23/sports/23kepnerweb1/23kepnerweb1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/04/23/sports/23kepnerweb1/23kepnerweb1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank