.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/23/movies/i-feel-pretty-amy-schumer-beauty.html', 'snippet': 'Coursing through pop culture, this attitude puts the onus on women to improve their self-esteem instead of criticizing societal beauty standards.', 'lead_paragraph': '“I Feel Pretty” is based on a pretty little lie: Looks don’t matter. It’s what’s on the inside that counts.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/24/arts/24beauty/merlin_137107005_1eba537c-30e5-4add-b08b-7d5337b860ab-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/24/arts/24beauty/merlin_137107005_1eba537c-30e5-4add-b08b-7d5337b860ab-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/24/arts/24beauty/merlin_137107005_1eba537c-30e5-4add-b08b-7d5337b860ab-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/24/arts/24beauty/merlin_137107005_1eba537c-30e5-4add-b08b-7d5337b860ab-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/24/arts/24beauty/24beauty-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/04/24/arts/24beauty/24beauty-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/24/arts/24beauty/24beauty-thum