arment industry looks set to return to business as usual. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'DHAKA, Bangladesh — Mahmudul Hassan Hridoy, a sweet-natured, soft-spoken 32-year-old, walks with a crutch and suffers from terrible headaches. Sometimes at night he pulls his hair out while he sleeps. He is single, though he has been married; his wife left him when he was in an accident and permanently injured. He owns a small pharmacy, and, once a month, he holds meetings there. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/24/fashion/24RENAPLAZA-memorial/merlin_137220756_56dc0f2d-ddb7-44cb-a2a1-67f0182bb2bf-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/24/fashion/24RENAPLAZA-memorial/merlin_137220756_56dc0f2d-ddb7-44cb-a2a1-67f0182bb2bf-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/24/fashion/24RENAPLAZA-memorial/merlin_137220756_56dc0f2d-ddb7-44cb-a2a1-67f0182bb2bf-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/24/fashion/24RENAPLAZA-memorial/merlin_137220756_56dc0f2d-ddb7-44cb-a2a1-67f0182bb2bf-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/24/fashion/24RENAPLAZA-memorial/24RENAPLAZA-memorial-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/04/24/fashion/24RENAPLAZA-memorial/24RENAPLAZA-memorial-thumbStandard.