rrent popularity of contemporary design. And, judging by these highlights from the fair, is it any wonder?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/24/t-magazine/art/salone-slide-Q82K/salone-slide-Q82K-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 866, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/24/t-magazine/art/salone-slide-Q82K/salone-slide-Q82K-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 866}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/24/t-magazine/art/salone-slide-Q82K/salone-slide-Q82K-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 710, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/24/t-magazine/art/salone-slide-Q82K/salone-slide-Q82K-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1420, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/24/t-magazine/art/salone-slide-Q82K/salone-slide-Q82K-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/04/24/t-magazine/art/salone-slide-Q82K/salone-slide-Q82K-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/24/t-magazine/art/salone-slide-Q82K/salone-slide-Q82K-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '13 Great Things We Saw at Milan’s Design Fair', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name'