 but the terms are so broad that they may not limit presidential war-making.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/24/opinion/terrorism-congress-kaine-corker.html', 'snippet': 'A bipartisan bill prescribes when and where force can be used, but the terms are so broad that they may not limit presidential war-making.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When President Trump bombed Syria recently, for the second time in a little over a year, he did so, again, without authorization from Congress and with no real debate by lawmakers. That has been the pattern for presidents since the forever war against terrorists began after the Sept. 11 attacks.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/25/opinion/25wed1/25wed1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 393, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/25/opinion/25wed1/25wed1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 393}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/25/opinion/25wed1/25wed1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 670, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/25/opinion/25wed1/25wed1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 989, 'width': 1511, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/25/opinion/25wed1/25wed1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/04/25/opinion/25wed1/25wed1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None,