}, {'abstract': 'Republicans may balk at some of the provisions, while Democrats, who have long criticized the existing deal, may argue that the president’s changes do not go far enough.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/25/us/politics/nafta-hurdle-congress.html', 'snippet': 'Republicans may balk at some of the provisions, while Democrats, who have long criticized the existing deal, may argue that the president’s changes do not go far enough.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The United States is pushing to quickly conclude a revised North American Free Trade Agreement during talks in Washington this week, but another, potentially insurmountable obstacle looms: getting such a deal through Congress.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/26/business/26dc-naftaPRINT/26dc-naftaPRINT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/26/business/26dc-naftaPRINT/26dc-naftaPRINT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/26/business/26dc-naftaPRINT/26dc-naftaPRINT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/26/business/26dc-naftaPRINT/26dc-naftaPRINT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/26/business/26dc-naftaPRINT/26dc-nafta-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2