'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/3c2e7acb-1551-5abc-a363-565e945d4e8e', 'word_count': 249, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3c2e7acb-1551-5abc-a363-565e945d4e8e'}, {'abstract': 'Peter Livolsi’s painfully quirky tale features two damaged young men — and a woman obsessed with her long-ago mentor, R. Buckminster Fuller.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/26/movies/review-house-of-tomorrow.html', 'snippet': 'Peter Livolsi’s painfully quirky tale features two damaged young men — and a woman obsessed with her long-ago mentor, R. Buckminster Fuller.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As if his name weren’t enough of a burden, Sebastian Prendergast (Asa Butterfield) must also deal with a grandmother, Josephine (Ellen Burstyn), whose controlling ways are capped only by her obsession with her long-ago mentor, the architect and inventor R. Buckminster Fuller.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/27/arts/27houseoftomorrow-1/merlin_137027004_df14acf9-1a2b-4754-a317-bd772c3896b4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 323, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/27/arts/27houseoftomorrow-1/merlin_137027004_df14acf9-1a2b-4754-a317-bd772c3896b4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 323}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/27/arts/27houseoftomorrow-1/merlin_137027004_df14acf9-1a2b-4754-a317-bd772c3896b4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 552, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/27/arts/27houseoftomorrow-1/merlin_137027004_df14acf9-1a2b-4754-a317-bd772c3896b4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 970, 'width': 1800, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'ra