e54d21-ae4b-51c1-9b89-5379c5b6aa39'}, {'abstract': 'Olivier Assayas’s “Cold Water” follows two French adolescents on the road to nowhere. It is finally getting a theatrical release in the United States.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/26/movies/rewind-column-olivier-assayas-cold-water.html', 'snippet': 'Olivier Assayas’s “Cold Water” follows two French adolescents on the road to nowhere. It is finally getting a theatrical release in the United States.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Cold Water,” Olivier Assayas’s paean to adolescent desperation, is as bracing as its title suggests. Screened at the New York Film Festival in 1994, it introduced American audiences to a promising talent who became one of France’s leading filmmakers. Despite positive reviews, “Cold Water” was never commercially released here in part because of difficulty in clearing the rights to material sung by Janis Joplin, Bob Dylan, Leonard Cohen and others.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/27/arts/27COLDWATER-1/merlin_137114973_e2f33835-b0b7-4cb9-98f9-17afbce91b1a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 363, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/27/arts/27COLDWATER-1/merlin_137114973_e2f33835-b0b7-4cb9-98f9-17afbce91b1a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 363}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/27/arts/27COLDWATER-1/merlin_137114973_e2f33835-b0b7-4cb9-98f9-17afbce91b1a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 620, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/27/arts/27COLDWATER-1/merlin_137114973_e2f33835-b0b7-4cb9-98f9-17afbce91b1a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1200, 'width': 1982