east. You’ll uncover outposts from Zurich and South Asia, transplants from Chelsea, and one of the oldest arts centers in town.', 'lead_paragraph': 'And so the hottest gallery neighborhood in New York is … nowhere in particular! With rents ever higher in Chelsea’s old garages and the Lower East Side’s tenements, nearly a dozen homesteading dealers have moved to a few blocks of terra nullius hemmed in by SoHo, TriBeCa and the Civic Center. Centered on Walker Street, these galleries — a mix of Chelsea refugees, peripatetic veterans of downtown and a few new kids — have imparted fresh energy to one of Lower Manhattan’s last ungentrified zones.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/27/arts/27guide-soho10/merlin_137100507_3c850fcb-9b0a-4a69-9c57-416fd00f4cfe-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 743, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/27/arts/27guide-soho10/merlin_137100507_3c850fcb-9b0a-4a69-9c57-416fd00f4cfe-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 743}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/27/arts/27guide-soho10/merlin_137100507_3c850fcb-9b0a-4a69-9c57-416fd00f4cfe-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 827, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/27/arts/27guide-soho10/merlin_137100507_3c850fcb-9b0a-4a69-9c57-416fd00f4cfe-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1653, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/27/arts/27guide-soho10/27guide-soho10-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'c