rest of Andre Braddy, a math teacher charged with sexually abusing a 14-year-old boy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/26/nyregion/brooklyn-math-teacher-sex-abuse-charges.html', 'snippet': 'Parents and students at Lenox Academy in Brooklyn said they were shocked by the arrest of Andre Braddy, a math teacher charged with sexually abusing a 14-year-old boy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To his students at the Lenox Academy middle school in Canarsie, Brooklyn, Andre Braddy was a “very nice teacher” who was engaged enough to joke with his students. He was also by turns “really serious,” and disciplined enough to make them concentrate and do their homework.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/27/nyregion/27teacher/merlin_137354175_1ebd4999-02e8-4354-89bc-c592308f2d41-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/27/nyregion/27teacher/merlin_137354175_1ebd4999-02e8-4354-89bc-c592308f2d41-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/27/nyregion/27teacher/merlin_137354175_1ebd4999-02e8-4354-89bc-c592308f2d41-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/27/nyregion/27teacher/merlin_137354175_1ebd4999-02e8-4354-89bc-c592308f2d41-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/27/nyregion/27teacher/27teacher-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnai