, 'height': 709, 'width': 658, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/29/obituaries/29gump1/gump1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/04/29/obituaries/29gump1/gump1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/29/obituaries/29gump1/gump1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Jean Gump, Tireless Fighter for Social Justice, Dies at 90', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Jean Gump, 90, Unflinching Social Justice Activist, Dies', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gump, Jean', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civil Rights and Liberties', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nuclear Weapons', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests and Riots', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-04-26T22:38:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Obits', 'section_name': 'Obituaries', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Roberts', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Roberts', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/4a58fdeb-10a4-5595-b8c1-7e6630773996', 'word_count': 1287, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4a58fdeb-10a4-5595-b8c1-7e6630773996'}, {'abstract': 'Storms, stars and survival in small spaces — the cosmos in a storefront.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/26/arts/design/art-galleries-to-see-now-on-the-lower-east-side.html', 'snippet': 'Storms, stars and survival in small spaces — the cosmos in a storefront.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Galleries, small and midsize, are having a rough ride. Rents keep climbing. So do art-fair fees. And certain people who might help pay the gallery bills — collectors, big-museum curators — keep not showing up except at a handful of spaces with social cachet and publicity machines. Plus, a sizable portion of the art audience has taken to doing its looking online, raising the question: Why have physical galleries at all?', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/27/arts/27guide-les2/merlin_137219640_e633c4cc-d180-418b-9ff8-fc5b6c95997f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 461, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/27/arts/27guide-les2/merlin_137219640_e633c4cc-d180-418b-9ff8-fc5b6c95997f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 461}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/27/arts/27guide-les2/merlin_137219640_e633c4cc-d180-418b-9ff8-fc5b6c95997f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 787, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/27/arts/27guide-les2/merlin_137219640_e633c4cc-d180-418b-9ff8-fc5b6c95997f-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1500, 'width': 1952, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/27/arts/27guide-les2/merlin_137219640_e633c4cc-d180-418b-9ff8-fc5b6c95997f-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType