n-michael-healy-paragon-among-green-berets-dies-at-91.html', 'snippet': 'General Healy served for decades and helped lift morale when he took command of Special Forces in Vietnam after a scandalous murder case in 1969.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Michael D. Healy, a highly decorated Army major general who became a paragon for Green Berets, especially when he led them in Vietnam after a scandalous murder case in 1969 had depleted morale, died on April 14 at a hospital near his home in Jacksonville, Fla. He was 91.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/29/obituaries/29healy1/28healy1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 779, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/29/obituaries/29healy1/28healy1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 779}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/29/obituaries/29healy1/28healy1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 790, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/29/obituaries/29healy1/28healy1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1579, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/29/obituaries/29healy1/28healy1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/04/29/obituaries/29healy1/28healy1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/29/obituaries/29healy1/28healy1-thumbLarge.jpg