f-5cda-958f-0c7c931e040c', 'word_count': 1122, 'uri': 'nyt://article/35b9e2ae-a89f-5cda-958f-0c7c931e040c'}, {'abstract': 'A legendary health and sexuality book’s overlooked legacy of righteous political rage.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/28/opinion/sunday/the-forgotten-anger-of-our-bodies-ourselves.html', 'snippet': 'A legendary health and sexuality book’s overlooked legacy of righteous political rage.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The second edition of “Our Bodies, Ourselves,” published in 1976 by Simon & Schuster, featured on Page 229 something I’d never seen before, and I don’t believe I’ve seen it anywhere else since: a photograph of a woman having an abortion.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/29/sunday-review/29gumport2/29gumport2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 755, 'width': 506, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/29/sunday-review/29gumport2/29gumport2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 755, 'width': 506, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/29/sunday-review/29gumport2/29gumport2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/04/29/sunday-review/29gumport2/29gumport2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/29/sunday-review/29gumport2/29gumport2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Forgotten Anger of ‘Our Bodies, Oursel