 'nyt://article/30b00601-fbf8-50a7-a602-38eca78ce353'}, {'abstract': 'Dr. Cone argued for racial equality and an understanding of the Christian Gospel that elevated the voices of the oppressed.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/29/obituaries/james-cone-dead.html', 'snippet': 'Dr. Cone argued for racial equality and an understanding of the Christian Gospel that elevated the voices of the oppressed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Rev. Dr. James H. Cone, a central figure in the development of black liberation theology in the 1960s and ’70s who argued for racial justice and an interpretation of the Christian Gospel that elevated the voices of the oppressed, died on Saturday in Manhattan. He was 79.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/30/business/30Cone-obit/merlin_23068533_e2a1b918-ccfe-4433-b9e7-3a7bfe56cc8c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 805, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/30/business/30Cone-obit/merlin_23068533_e2a1b918-ccfe-4433-b9e7-3a7bfe56cc8c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 805}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/30/business/30Cone-obit/merlin_23068533_e2a1b918-ccfe-4433-b9e7-3a7bfe56cc8c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 764, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/30/business/30Cone-obit/merlin_23068533_e2a1b918-ccfe-4433-b9e7-3a7bfe56cc8c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1937, 'width': 1444, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/30/business/30Cone-obit/merlin_23068533_e2a1b918-c