es who had accused him of defamation and took further aim at Mikhail D. Prokhorov.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Grigory Rodchenkov, Russia’s former antidoping lab chief who in 2016 publicly detailed the nation’s Olympic doping schemes and upended Russia’s standing in international sports, responded to a defamation suit on Monday, countersuing several Russian Olympians and taking aim at the oligarch who is partly financing their legal fight: Mikhail D. Prokhorov, the controlling owner of the N.B.A.’s Brooklyn Nets.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/30/sports/31rodchpic1/merlin_80750222_9415933a-f915-4b24-8320-b1469106fa09-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 888, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/30/sports/31rodchpic1/merlin_80750222_9415933a-f915-4b24-8320-b1469106fa09-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 888}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/30/sports/31rodchpic1/merlin_80750222_9415933a-f915-4b24-8320-b1469106fa09-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 692, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/30/sports/31rodchpic1/merlin_80750222_9415933a-f915-4b24-8320-b1469106fa09-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1384, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/30/sports/31rodchpic1/31rodchpic1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/04/30/sports/31rodchpic1/31rodchpic1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumb