oli.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/30/dining/what-to-cook-right-now-newsletter.html', 'snippet': 'Tonight, make David Tanis’s recipe for asparagus frittata, salmon burgers, or beef and broccoli.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Good morning. It’s an uncertain, difficult world we live in, sometimes hard to explain, and all the more so when you look around and it’s as if everyone’s mad at you, all the time, even when they say they’re not. Here’s some nickel advice: Take a good long walk after you read The Times in the morning, however you read it, and then cook dinner at the end of the day, even if it’s just ramen from Sevs with a poached egg, scallions and a dusting of sesame seeds. Be active. Take care. That’s the ticket to ride.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/02/dining/02kitchen1/02kitchen1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/02/dining/02kitchen1/02kitchen1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/02/dining/02kitchen1/02kitchen1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/02/dining/02kitchen1/02kitchen1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/02/dining/02kitchen1/02kitchen1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/05/02/dining/02kitchen1/02kitchen1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwid