d exhibition platform, from her family home, where eccentric artworks are part of the furniture.', 'lead_paragraph': 'From the outside, Nathalie Assi’s white-stucco house looks as grandly traditional as the others that line the quiet Kensington street where she lives with her husband and three children. This is one of London’s most venerable neighborhoods: Queen Victoria grew up around the corner in Kensington Palace, now home to Prince William and his young family. But inside Assi’s front door, stuffy convention comes abruptly to a stop.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/05/t-magazine/05tmag-seeds-slide-HNHS/05tmag-seeds-slide-HNHS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/03/05/t-magazine/05tmag-seeds-slide-HNHS/05tmag-seeds-slide-HNHS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/05/t-magazine/05tmag-seeds-slide-HNHS/05tmag-seeds-slide-HNHS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/05/t-magazine/05tmag-seeds-slide-HNHS/05tmag-seeds-slide-HNHS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/05/t-magazine/05tmag-seeds-slide-HNHS/05tmag-seeds-slide-HNHS-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/03/05/t-magazine/05tmag-seeds-slide-HNHS/05tmag-seeds-slide-HNHS-thumbSt