e-jazz-women-metoo.html', 'snippet': 'A 14-member collective battling harassment in improvised music is releasing guidelines for more equitable workplaces and expectations for change.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Over the past year a steady stream of public testimonials from female jazz musicians has made clear what most already knew privately: Sexism and harassment are deeply ingrained in the improvised-music world.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/01/arts/01jazzwomen1/01jazzwomen1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/01/arts/01jazzwomen1/01jazzwomen1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/01/arts/01jazzwomen1/01jazzwomen1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/01/arts/01jazzwomen1/01jazzwomen1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/01/arts/01jazzwomen1/01jazzwomen1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/05/01/arts/01jazzwomen1/01jazzwomen1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/01/arts/01jazzwomen1/01jazzwomen1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Women Fighting Sexism in Jazz Have a Voice. And Now, a Code of Conduct.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Women Seeking a New Jazz Age', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jazz', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': '#MeToo Movement', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sexual Harassment', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'We Have Voice Collective', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-04-30T17:21:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Giovanni Russonello', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Giovanni', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Russonello', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fc27134f-01e9-52dc-9042-5e6e863202e1', 'word_count': 1099, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fc27134f-01e9-52dc-9042-5e6e863202e1'}, {'abstract': 'Jim Lahey has added a cafe to his wholesale bakery in Hell’s Kitchen.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/30/dining/sullivan-street-bakery.html', 'snippet': 'Jim Lahey has added a cafe to his wholesale bakery in Hell’s Kitchen.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s been nearly 18 years since Jim Lahey moved his Italian-style Sullivan Street Bakery to West 47th Street from SoHo, keeping the name. During that time, he’s tweaked the Hell’s Kitchen location more than once. Now, he’s given it a complete overhaul and will open on Thursday, adding a bright new cafe and upgrading some of the equipment in the big wholesale bakery that may be hidden from view but is the soul of the operation. The menu for the light, airy cafe is the work of the corporate executive chef Morgan Schofield. It starts with breakfast items like brioche French toast and includes soups, salads, pastries and made-to-order or grab-and-go sandwiches. There’s a stretch of retail counter for breads, other baked goods, and Mr. Lahey’s signature Roman pizzas: Sullivan Street Bakery, 533 West 47th Street, 212-265-5580, sullivanstreetbakery.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/18/dining/18burnersullivan/18burnersullivan-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 345, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/18/dining/18burnersullivan/18burnersullivan-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 345}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/18/dining/18burnersullivan/18burnersullivan-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 589, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/18/dining/18burnersullivan/18burnersullivan-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1178, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/18/dining/18burnersullivan/18burnersullivan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/04/18/dining/18burnersullivan/18burnersullivan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/18/dining/18burnersullivan/18burnersullivan-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline