7c2-59988018e738', 'word_count': 850, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a0ccc194-7782-5794-87c2-59988018e738'}, {'abstract': 'Wilson set career-highs in goals, assists and ice time while often playing on Washington’s top line with Alex Ovechkin.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/04/30/sports/hockey/washington-capitals-tom-wilson.html', 'snippet': 'Wilson set career-highs in goals, assists and ice time while often playing on Washington’s top line with Alex Ovechkin.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ARLINGTON, Va. — Washington Capitals forward Tom Wilson wore the label like a tattoo during his first four N.H.L. seasons: a fourth-line enforcer who often committed bad penalties with devastating hits.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/01/sports/01capitalsweb1/01capitalsweb1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 422, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/01/sports/01capitalsweb1/01capitalsweb1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 422}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/01/sports/01capitalsweb1/01capitalsweb1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 720, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/01/sports/01capitalsweb1/01capitalsweb1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1441, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/01/sports/01capitalsweb1/01capitalsweb1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/05/01/sports/01capitalsweb1/01capitalswe